        "original_id": "200f4777-4757-5a5e-9c05-8dde47d87a1a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alessia Cara, Zedd, Logic, Khalid, 6ix\n- Songs: \"Stay\", \"1-800-273-8255\"\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100\n\nFacts:\n- In 2017, Alessia Cara collaborated with producer Zedd to create the single \"Stay\".\n- In 2017, Alessia Cara featured with rapper Logic on the song \"1-800-273-8255\".\n- \"1-800-273-8255\" is a song by American hip hop artist Logic.\n- Logic and 6ix produced the song \"1-800-273-8255\".\n- The song \"1-800-273-8255\" features guest vocals from Alessia Cara and Khalid.\n- On the Billboard Hot 100, \"Stay\" reached number 7 and \"1-800-273-8255\" reached number 3.\n- \"Stay\" and \"1-800-273-8255\" became Alessia Cara's third and fourth songs to reach the US top 10.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
