        "text": "Page: Alessia Cara. Sentence: In 2017, Cara collaborated with producer Zedd to create the single \"Stay\", and rapper Logic to feature in his song \"1-800-273-8255\".\nPage: Alessia Cara. Sentence: With both songs reaching number 7 and number 3 respectively on the \"Billboard\" Hot 100, they became Cara's third and fourth songs to reach the US top 10.\nPage: 1-800-273-8255 (song). Sentence: \"1-800-273-8255\" is a song by American hip hop artist Logic.\nPage: 1-800-273-8255 (song). Sentence: Produced by Logic and 6ix, the song features guest vocals from singer-songwriters Alessia Cara and Khalid.",
